{
  "uid": "ci-logs",
  "title": "CI Logs",
  "timezone": "utc",
  "refresh": "",
  "time": { "from": "now-7d", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "level",
        "label": "Level",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "error,warning,info,debug,trace",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "sort": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "pr_number",
        "label": "PR",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "query_result(group by (pr_number) (count_over_time(ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\"}[$__range:])))",
        "regex": "/pr_number=\"([^\"]+)\"/",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 3
      },
      {
        "name": "build_id",
        "label": "Build",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "query_result(group by (build_id) (count_over_time(ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\"}[$__range:])))",
        "regex": "/build_id=\"([^\"]+)\"/",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 3
      },
      {
        "name": "source",
        "label": "Source",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "ci-operator",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": false,
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "ci-operator", "value": "ci-operator" },
        "sort": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "logquery",
        "label": "Filter",
        "description": "Additional LogsQL filter (e.g. _msg:~\"timeout\")",
        "type": "textbox",
        "current": { "selected": false, "text": "", "value": "" }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 50,
      "title": "Dashboard Guide",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": true,
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": 51,
          "title": "",
          "type": "text",
          "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
          "options": {
            "mode": "markdown",
            "content": "### How to use this dashboard\n\nThis dashboard shows ci-operator logs organized by source, with each source displayed in its own panel to preserve log ordering.\n\n**Filters:**\n- **Level** — filter by log level (error, warning, info, debug, trace). Start with \"error\" to find failures.\n- **PR** / **Build** — narrow to specific PRs or builds. Leave as \"All\" for cross-build analysis.\n- **Source** — select which log sources to display. Each selected source gets its own panel.\n- **Filter** — additional LogsQL expression appended to the query (e.g. `_msg:~\"timeout\"`, `component:metricsAgent`).\n\n**Tips:**\n- Set Level to \"error\" first to see what's failing across all builds.\n- Select a specific PR to see all its log activity.\n- The histogram at the top of each log panel shows volume over time — spikes indicate bursts of activity.\n- Click any log entry to expand it and see all fields.\n- Use [Explore](/explore) with VictoriaLogs for complex queries or stats aggregations.\n\n**Example filters:**\n| Goal | Filter value |\n|------|--------|\n| Timeout errors | `_msg:~\"timeout\"` |\n| Step failures | `_msg:~\"step.*failed\"` |\n| Specific component | `component:metricsAgent` |"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Logs: $source",
      "type": "logs",
      "gridPos": { "h": 25, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "source:$source AND level:~\"${level:pipe}\" AND pr_number:~\"${pr_number:pipe}\" AND build_id:~\"${build_id:pipe}\" $logquery",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "repeat": "source",
      "repeatDirection": "v",
      "maxPerRow": 1
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39
}
